imgproxy
--------
https://github.com/imgproxy/imgproxy
Copyright (c) 2017 Sergey Alexandrovich and imgproxy contributors
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

internal/dialect/imgproxy reimplements imgproxy's URL grammar and
processing-option semantics from handlers/path.go (path
redenormalisation), options/parser/url.go (source URL decoding),
options/parser/parse.go and options/parser/apply.go (option argument
rules). The code was rewritten against xtandard-image's own request model
and modified as described in the package documentation.
internal/vips/shim.c and internal/vips/shim.h contain portions derived from
imgproxy's vips/vips.c, https://github.com/imgproxy/imgproxy
Copyright (c) 2017 Sergey Alexandrovich
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0,
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
Modifications (reduced operation set, error capture at the failure site,
refcounted VipsBlob input buffers) are marked in the file headers.

